msgid "About the OpenStore"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The OpenStore is the official app store for Ubuntu Touch. It is an open "
"source project run by a team of volunteers with help from the community. "
"You can discover and install new apps on your Ubuntu Touch device. You can "
"also upload and manage your own apps for publication. The OpenStore "
"encourages the apps published within to be open source, but also accepts "
"proprietary apps."
